{"title":"2008 IMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The 49th <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO\">IMO</a> occurred in 2008 in Madrid, Spain. 101 countries participated, and teams were of 6 students.  Unofficially, China finished first, with 217 out of 252 possible points. 47 gold, 100 silver, and 120 bronze medals were awarded.\n</p><p>The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems\">Entire Test</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 3\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 4\"> Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 5\"> Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 6\"> Problem 6</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">IMO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2008 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO\" title=\"2007 IMO\">2007 IMO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_IMO\" title=\"2009 IMO\">2009 IMO</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018053758\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage